
## Get Login Page
GET http://localhost:8001/login-page


### Get 
GET http://localhost:8001/
Accept: application/json


### Create new user
POST http://localhost:8001/create/user/v2
Accept: */*
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admina",
  "email": "admina"
}


### Post via form-data
POST http://localhost:8001/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

user_id=1&username=admin


@file_id = 42

### Download file (change the ID to an available file)
GET http://localhost:8001/read/file/v2/{{file_id}}/download
Accept: application/octet-stream


### Download first bytes (checks range streaming)
GET http://localhost:8001/read/file/v2/{{file_id}}/download
Range: bytes=0-511

